config MTK_VIRT_ADSP
	tristate "Mediatek Auto Virtio ADSP Device"
	bool "Support virtio adsp  mode"
	depends on SND_VIRTIO
	help
	  This is MTK virt adsp driver.
	  Say Y if you would like to enable virt adsp,
	  If unsure, say N.
	  The auto product with hypervisor guest os use virtio adsp device.
